# Semantic tokens from the grammar's `color` lines: functions, parameters,
# constants (`readonly`), types (a constant whose value is a container or
# an error set), an enum's fields, error names, enum literals and error
# values, each with `declaration` where it is defined, and each name and
# member of them (`p.sum`) as its definition; fields and `var`s keep the
# colour of their tokens. With the server the hooks.zig `--editor` writes,
# on project/colors.zig.
initialize quiet
open colors.zig
tokens colors.zig
